    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Burglar is a game where you will be making your own cat and walking around taking cat toys and treats! Sneakily walk around from apartment to apartment thieving. If the other cats see you, you better run! you're a little faster than them, but not much faster, and if they catch you it's game over.  Other cats have nice stuff. Why can't it be yours!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customize Your Cat</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/c325fa668864d861b8a29f16ae6017ee.poster.avif?t=1740013713\" width=546 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/c325fa668864d861b8a29f16ae6017ee.webm?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/c325fa668864d861b8a29f16ae6017ee.mp4?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from an array of hats and skins to make your cat look as cute as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Sneak Around. Run And Hide!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/0de74a0a1b85064a62345e01e18cab7e.poster.avif?t=1740013713\" width=646 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/0de74a0a1b85064a62345e01e18cab7e.webm?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/0de74a0a1b85064a62345e01e18cab7e.mp4?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for the perfect time to run out and collect toys and treats. If you're caught, you can still run for cover wherever you can find it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Take Their Stuff!</u></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/6f3398263a7a368fad4f966df59d5b98.poster.avif?t=1740013713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/6f3398263a7a368fad4f966df59d5b98.webm?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/6f3398263a7a368fad4f966df59d5b98.mp4?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk up to the other cats' toys, food, and treats to collect them. Take all their stuff and move on to the next house!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cat Burglar is a game where you will be making your own cat and walking around taking cat toys and treats! Sneakily walk around from apartment to apartment thieving. If the other cats see you, you better run! you're a little faster than them, but not much faster, and if they catch you it's game over.  Other cats have nice stuff. Why can't it be yours!?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Customize Your Cat</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/c325fa668864d861b8a29f16ae6017ee.poster.avif?t=1740013713\" width=546 height=308 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/c325fa668864d861b8a29f16ae6017ee.webm?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/c325fa668864d861b8a29f16ae6017ee.mp4?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from an array of hats and skins to make your cat look as cute as possible!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Sneak Around. Run And Hide!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/0de74a0a1b85064a62345e01e18cab7e.poster.avif?t=1740013713\" width=646 height=364 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/0de74a0a1b85064a62345e01e18cab7e.webm?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/0de74a0a1b85064a62345e01e18cab7e.mp4?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wait for the perfect time to run out and collect toys and treats. If you're caught, you can still run for cover wherever you can find it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Take Their Stuff!</u></strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/6f3398263a7a368fad4f966df59d5b98.poster.avif?t=1740013713\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/6f3398263a7a368fad4f966df59d5b98.webm?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2925570/extras/6f3398263a7a368fad4f966df59d5b98.mp4?t=1740013713\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walk up to the other cats' toys, food, and treats to collect them. Take all their stuff and move on to the next house!</p>",
